  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "MCP server for Ecommerce Store Discovery. Shopify, WooCommerce, or BigCommerce stores that sell a product, each confirmed on its own homepage, with platform evidence, payments, product count, Tranco rank, and contact links. Runs on Apify. Clay-ready output.",
